      <p>Need cheap AI API keys for your VPS workflows? Check <a href="https://apirank.vip" target="_blank" rel="noopener">APIRank</a> for provider comparisons — DeepSeek, OpenAI, Anthropic, and more, ranked by price and performance.</p>

      <h2>Performance Analysis</h2>
      <p>In our testing, the $9.99 Professional plan delivered adequate performance for lightweight AI agent workloads. Running Ollama with Llama 3.1 8B produced around 15-18 tokens/second — sufficient for development and testing but not suitable for production-grade inference at scale.</p>
      <p>The AMD EPYC processors handle moderate concurrent tasks well, but the SATA SSD becomes a bottleneck when running database-heavy AI pipelines. For $22.88/month, you get 4GB RAM and 6TB bandwidth, which is competitive against Vultr's $24 4GB plan — though Vultr's NVMe storage gives it an edge for I/O-heavy workloads.</p>

